WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.151
Hi, I'm Mark. Last Monday was a terrible day. Nothing went right!

2
00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:08.366
My alarm clock didn't ring.

3
00:00:08.816 --> 00:00:11.834
I woke up at eight thirty, and I didn't have breakfast!

4
00:00:14.084 --> 00:00:15.663
I ran to the bus stop…

5
00:00:16.113 --> 00:00:19.225
…but I didn't catch the bus. It left without me!

6
00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:23.936
Then it rained, and I didn't have my umbrella.

7
00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:25.965
I arrived at work wet!

8
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:30.305
At work, my computer didn't work.

9
00:00:30.755 --> 00:00:34.284
So I didn't finish my report. My boss wasn't happy.

10
00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:39.042
But the coffee was good. That's something!

11
00:00:39.492 --> 00:00:42.743
And you? Tell me something you didn't do yesterday.

